Apply explicit terminal discards in the bindless-aware mode after existing store proofs. Keep hoisted, layered and continued passes conservative.

diff --git a/graphics/nvn/gfx/nvn/nvn_mtl.m b/graphics/nvn/gfx/nvn/nvn_mtl.m
